{
  "id": "celebrations-prime-collection",
  "name": "Celebrations Prime Collection",
  "category": "product_promotion",
  "description": {
    "text": "A collection for the Pokémon 25th anniversary, first sold at GAME in the United Kingdom from 8 October 2021 and later from Amazon in North America. It held a Celebrations Collector Chest two weeks before the chest's own release, with its three remixed promos Mimikyu δ, Light Toxtricity and Hydreigon C, plus jumbo copies of all three; Dragapult Prime as a promo and a jumbo, as in the Celebrations Collection—Dragapult Prime; two binders, a coin and five booster packs. All the promos carry the 25th Anniversary logo.",
